          "description": "**Returns the async analysis job status. Checks the progress of both the `codebase_start_job_related_files_search` and `codebase_start_job_analysis` jobs. You must poll using `codebase_get_job_status` tool until `success`/`failure`. This tool internally waits up to 50s/request. Avoid assuming failure before terminal status. You are forbidden to finish response while polling is running.**",
