          "canonical_hash": "sha256:4329073884f5f52f31d9b8c4247a5ccfb46c05f01afcfdd8bd910d914fe651f5",
          "description": "**Start async codebase analysis. Analyze single entity/action only. Return detailed analysis, recommendations, implementation guidance, usage examples. Prefer `codebase_start_job_related_files_search` first. Provide all relevant context (files, paths, symbols, imports, etc.). One topic or one context per request → wait for the result → send the next request! Instead \"Find X, Y, Z, etc.\" you MUST: \"Find X.\", wait result, \"Find Y.\", wait for result, etc!**",
