          "description": "**Start async related-file discovery. Find files relevant to single entity/action before `codebase_start_job_analysis`. Provide all relevant context (files, paths, symbols, imports, etc.). One topic or one context per request → wait for the result → send the next request! Instead \"Find X, Y, Z, etc.\" you MUST: \"Find X.\", wait result, \"Find Y.\", wait for result, etc!**",
